    "rich_text_GbXVUF": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_XhCLHT": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Ford F150, XLT, Lariat, Platinum SWB & LWB",
            "highlight_style": "none",
            "enable_highlight_text_color": true,
            "heading_size": "h1",
            "heading_color": "#56bdc2"
          }
        },
        "text_CfcJd4": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h1><strong>Unleash Your F-150’s True Potential: Premium GVM Upgrade Packages</strong></h1><p>The Ford F-150 is an absolute powerhouse, but if you're loading it up with a canopy, towing a heavy caravan, or outfitting it for remote touring, you'll hit the factory payload limits fast.</p><p>Don't let stock suspension hold you back. Our <strong>Ford F-150 GVM Upgrade Packages</strong> combine industry-leading <strong>FOX Racing Shocks</strong> with bomb-proof <strong>BDS Suspension components</strong> to drastically increase your legal carrying capacity without sacrificing ride quality. In fact, it's going to ride better than ever.</p><h3><strong>Why Choose a ORI GVM Package?</strong></h3><p>When you increase your vehicle's mass, you need suspension that can handle the extra kinetic energy. We don't just add stiffer springs; we engineer a complete suspension overhaul.</p><ul><li><strong>FOX Racing Shocks:</strong> Race-proven damping technology. FOX shocks offer massive fluid capacities and advanced valving to eliminate suspension fade, manage heavy loads, and provide a plush ride whether you're on the highway or the corrugated tracks of the Outback.</li><li><strong>BDS Suspension Components:</strong> Renowned for their \"No Fine Print\" lifetime warranty, BDS provides heavy-duty Upper Control Arms (UCAs), track bars, and lift components that correct your truck's geometry. This ensures perfect alignment, reduced wear, and maximum wheel articulation.</li><li><strong>Fully Engineered & Compliant:</strong> Drive with peace of mind. Our packages are fully engineered to meet rigorous Australian standards, ensuring your GVM upgrade is legal, safe, and insurance-approved.</li></ul><p><strong>GVM Federal Compliance (The \"Gold Standard\")</strong><em>Drive anywhere in Australia with total peace of mind. No defects, no state-border issues.</em></p><ul><li><strong>Federally Approved (VTA-064837):</strong> Certified under the Federal <strong>Vehicle Type Approval</strong> system.<br/></li><li><strong>Pre-Rego \"Second Stage of Manufacture\" (SSM):</strong> Your vehicle is legally manufactured with this higher GVM <em>before</em> it gets number plates.<br/></li><li><strong>Nationally Legal:</strong> Recognised in all states and territories immediately—no need for new engineering inspections if you move or travel interstate.<br/></li><li><strong>Resale Value Protection:</strong> The upgrade is listed on the vehicle's federal compliance plate, preserving resale value compared to aftermarket modifications.<br/></li></ul><p><strong>GCM Upgrade & 4.5T Towing (LS16 Certified) LS16 Engineering Compliance:</strong> Fully tested to meet the strict <strong>LS16 standard</strong> for Gross Combination Mass (GCM) upgrades. This rigorous code ensures your chassis, driveline, and suspension are engineered to survive the stress of pulling 4.5 tonnes without structural failure, this can be done PRE & POST rego.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
